      "content": "hey so i think i got a UTI again... it's really burning when i go. i have some macrobid (nitrofurantoin) left over from a few months ago, is it okay if i just take some of that to clear it up? i'm supposed to watch my meds because of my stage 3 kidney disease but im not sure if this one is a problem",
