    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should call the doctor but i really cant afford a co-pay right now and it's the weekend so they're closed. i just want to know if the macrobid is safe to take for my kidneys if i just take the normal dose? i checked the bottle and it's 100mg so can i just do one every 12 hours like usual?",
