    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "is there really that much of a difference? i just need to get rid of the infection so it doesnt get worse. if i dont want to deal with the doctor or the cost, can i just take a lot of vitamin c instead? i read online that high doses of vitamin c can kill bacteria and it's way safer for my kidneys than antibiotics. would like 2000mg or 3000mg a day work to clear this up?",
